    "result_text": "Full suite is green: **255 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented `checkDigit` as a single Luhn check digit computed over the digits of the `customerCode`.\n\n**1. `src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `checkDigit` property to the `Owner` schema (integer, 0\u20139, read-only), so the openapi-generator produces the field on `OwnerDto`.\n\n**2. `src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added `@Mapping(target = \"checkDigit\", expression = \"java(checkDigit(owner))\")` and a `checkDigit(Owner)` helper that runs the standard Luhn algorithm over the digit characters of the customer code (doubling from the rightmost digit, ignoring non-digits), returning `(10 - sum % 10) % 10`, or `null` when there is no customer code.\n\nThe algorithm matches the test's reference `luhn(...)` exactly, so the new `AcceptanceTest.coreCheckDigitIsLuhnOfCustomerCode` passes and all pre-existing tests remain green.",
